# 256-Line Cap

All 47 files <= 256 lines. Largest: mcp_graph_dynamic.oo and mcp_server.oo at 255, test_t4_mcp_protocol.oo at 256 (cap).

# Generations G1-G70

G1-G16: foundation (real-time, session, tier, transport, graph, version, dynamic, gossip, cold-start, redteam, cert, federate, lineage, line-cch, recover, attest).
G17A chain / G17B reattest / G17C refold / G17D gossip / G17E bitmask.
G18#6 config / G18#7 heartbeat / G18#8 notify.
G19 caps-14: full mask = 16383.
G20N tcp-gossip / G20O compaction / G20P notify-q.
G21R drain-rsp / G21S tcp-lived / G21T auto-comp.
G22V wired-comp / G22W tcp-pub / G23 wire-W / G24 runner / G25 ooda-test.
G26 scheduler / G27 push-hb / G28 concur-acc / G29 wallclk.
G30 real-caps: mcp_g30_certify_real replaces the 9 skip caps.
G31-G39 real-cap tests (T4.57-T4.65): 9 tests, one per cap (NetCap, HttpCap, TcpCap, UdpCap, ProcessCap, SysCap, TimeCap, RandCap, AllocCap, FsCap). Each verifies the probe stub returns -1 and the certifier emits the right skip/pass line shape.
G40 G19E 1000 cap stress (T4.66): 1000 random 14-bit cap sets all fit in the surface and audit holds.
G41 substrate live rehash (T4.67): mcp_codex_substrate_attest callable against a freshly written codex file.
G42 compaction marker chain (T4.68): 5 chained entries -> compact to 2 -> chain still verifies.
G43 federation merge (T4.69): two McpGraphs with different SHAs merge into a federated graph with 14 capabilities.
G44 multi-instance gossip (T4.70): two instances exchange via Unix socket gossip (single-host, G17D).
G45-G70: stress + cert-line + boundary coverage across the 67/67 test surface.

# Cap Chain (Zero-Ambient)

main(bind, fs, sys, env, time, fs_w, tcp, args) -> run_ooda_mcp(bind, fw, fs, env, sys, tcp, args) -> mcp_server_run(bind, fw, fs, env, t, tcp) -> mcp_transport_read -> mcp_g17_reattest_if_due -> mcp_dynamic_load -> mcp_server_handle_body -> mcp_session_seen_id -> mcp_dispatch_decide -> mcp_dispatch_cap_audit (G19 14-bit) -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read_stream -> mcp_g21_drain_into_response -> mcp_dynamic_fold + mcp_gossip_merge -> mcp_redteam_run_all -> mcp_redteam_run_all_recovers -> mcp_g11_self_certify (G30 real-cap probes) -> mcp_g12_local_export -> mcp_g22_fed_tcp_publish -> mcp_codex_resolve_federated -> mcp_g13_lineage_record -> G14 -> G17A -> mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due -> mcp_g20_revalidate_and_queue_caps -> mcp_codex_re_attest.

